<title>FINLAND: KASOLA SEES POSITIVE PROFIT, SALES TRENDS.</title>
<headline>KASOLA SEES POSITIVE PROFIT, SALES TRENDS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish safety device group Kasola Oy said on Thursday it expected its profit trend to remain favourable and net sales to grow.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect net sales to go on growing in the whole group and the favourable earnings trend to continue,&quot; Kasola said in a statement with its results for May-December 1996.</p>
</text>
